 "message": "<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222; line-height: 1.5;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td>\n      <div style=\"background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #b91c1c;\">ERPNextPL</p>\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; color: #7f1d1d;\">Faktura sprzedaży jest przeterminowana</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563;\">\n          Faktura sprzedaży <strong>{{ doc.name }}</strong> zmieniła status na <strong>Overdue</strong> i wymaga weryfikacji.\n        </p>\n\n        <table cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width: 100%; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"width: 34%; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\"><strong>Numer faktury</strong></td>\n            <td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">{{ doc.name }}</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\"><strong>Kontrahent</strong></td>\n            <td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">{{ doc.customer }}</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\"><strong>Termin płatności</strong></td>\n            <td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">{{ doc.due_date }}</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\"><strong>Kwota zaległości</strong></td>\n            <td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">{{ doc.outstanding_amount }} {{ doc.currency }}</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong>Dni po terminie</strong></td>\n            <td>{{ frappe.utils.date_diff(frappe.utils.nowdate(), doc.due_date) }}</td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 18px 0 0 0;\">\n          <a href=\"{{ frappe.utils.get_url_to_form(doc.doctype, doc.name) }}\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #b91c1c; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px;\">Otwórz fakturę</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280;\">\n          Jeśli płatność została już zaksięgowana, można zignorować tę wiadomość.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n",
